      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAYLOR MADE BLUE (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at this track over 340m. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. One of the contenders. SOMETHING DARK (4) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (18.47) at Richmond in a Grade 5. Has first look at box 4 this time. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from five starts. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expected to be in this for a long way. ALL OVER ROVER (8) was a big winner two back scoring by 3.5 lengths then got further back last time but came home hard into second and beaten 2 lengths at Richmond (22.89). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to feature. SUNNY SUE (3) can sneak into the finish again.",
